{"speciesId":624,"names":{"fr":"Scalpion","es":"Pawniard","en":"Pawniard","ja":"コマタナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Tout son corps est fait de lames. Si une lame s’émousse, il va l’aiguiser contre une pierre au bord d’une rivière."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Blades comprise this Pokémon’s entire body. If battling dulls the blades, it sharpens them on stones by the river."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Obéissant aux directives d’un Scalproie, il s’agrippe à ses proies pour les poignarder."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They fight at Bisharp’s command. They cling to their prey and inflict damage by sinking their blades into it."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Ignoring their injuries, groups attack by sinking the blades that cover their bodies into their prey."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Ignoring their injuries, groups attack by sinking the blades that cover their bodies into their prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Tout son corps est fait de lames. Si une lame s’émousse, il va l’aiguiser contre une pierre au bord d’une rivière."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su cuerpo está provisto de hojas afiladas. Cuando se desgastan, las afila con cantos rodados a la orilla del río."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Blades comprise this Pokémon’s entire body. If battling dulls the blades, it sharpens them on stones by the river."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"全身が 刃物の ポケモン。 戦いで 刃こぼれすると 河原の 石で 刃を とぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ignorant leurs propres blessures, ils se jettent en groupe sur l’ennemi pour le déchirer de leur corps fait de lames."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ataca en grupo ignorando sus heridas y hundiendo en su presa las cuchillas que recubren su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Ignoring their injuries, groups attack by sinking the blades that cover their bodies into their prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"自分が 傷ついても 気にせず 集団で 全身の 刃物を 食いこませ 相手を 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tout son corps est fait de lames. Si une lame s’émousse, il va l’aiguiser contre une pierre au bord d’une rivière."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Su cuerpo está provisto de hojas afiladas. Cuando se desgastan, las afila con cantos rodados a la orilla del río."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Blades comprise this Pokémon’s entire body. If battling dulls the blades, it sharpens them on stones by the river."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"全身が 刃物の ポケモン。 戦いで 刃こぼれすると 河原の 石で 刃を とぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ignorant leurs propres blessures, ils se jettent en groupe sur l’ennemi pour le déchirer de leur corps fait de lames."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ataca en grupo ignorando sus heridas y hundiendo en su presa las cuchillas que recubren su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ignoring their injuries, groups attack by sinking the blades that cover their bodies into their prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"自分が 傷ついても 気にせず 集団で 全身の 刃物を 食いこませ 相手を 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Après avoir dépecé ses ennemis, il va sur les berges pour aiguiser ses lames sur une pierre. Chaque Scalpion a d’ailleurs son caillou fétiche."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Tras rebanar a sus presas, afila sus cuchillas con piedras de río. Cada Pawniard tiene una piedra favorita."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"After shredding its prey, it sharpens its blades on a stone by the river. Each Pawniard has its own favorite sharpening stone."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"獲物を 切り裂いたあとは 河原の 石で 刃を 研ぐ。 それぞれの コマタナに お気に入りの 石がある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il obéit à Scalproie au doigt et à l’œil sur le champ de bataille. Il fait résonner ses lames l’une contre l’autre une fois son ennemi tranché."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Acata las órdenes de Bisharp a pies juntillas. Cuando rebana a un oponente, hace sonar las cuchillas de sus brazos chocándolas entre sí."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It follows Bisharp’s orders to a tee when it attacks enemies. After slashing an opponent, Pawniard clangs both of its blades together."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"キリキザンの 命令の ままに 敵を 襲う。 相手を 切り裂くと 両手の 刃を 打ち鳴らすぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il accule ses ennemis en jouant de ses lames acérées, qu’il aiguise sur les pierres des berges."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Acorrala a los enemigos con las cuchillas de su cuerpo, que afila usando cantos rodados a la orilla del río."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It uses river stones to maintain the cutting edges of the blades covering its body. These sharpened blades allow it to bring down opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"鋭い 刃を 操り 敵を 追い詰める。 河原の 石で 体の 刃を 手入れする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vit en meute, sous les ordres d’un Scalproie. Il s’entraîne sans relâche en rêvant du jour où il sera chef de meute à son tour."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Forman grupos encabezados por un Bisharp. Se entrenan a diario soñando con llegar a liderar el grupo algún día."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"A pack of these Pokémon forms to serve a Bisharp boss. Each Pawniard trains diligently, dreaming of one day taking the lead."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"キリキザンを ボスとした 群れを つくる。 群れを 率いる ことを 夢見て 日々 鍛錬を 積む。"}],"varieties":[{"id":624,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"guillotine","learns":[[11,"level-up",62],[14,"level-up",62],[15,"level-up",62],[16,"